<title>UK: LucasVarity down after fall in ADRs.</title>
<headline>LucasVarity down after fall in ADRs.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in LucasVarity, the Anglo-U.S. manufacturer, dropped on Wednesday in London after U.S. selling prompted weakness in the ADRs in New York overnight, dealers said.</p>
<p>The shares were down 5p at 239-1/2p at 1146 GMT in London. In New York the ADRs closed $1-5/8 weaker at $39-3/4.</p>
<p>-- Andrew Langlands, London newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
